WEBVTT

00:05:59.055 --> 00:06:01.395
They made the most of what they had

00:06:01.395 --> 00:06:05.045
and gave us great education
and great values.

00:06:05.045 --> 00:06:08.265
I think that serves
as an incredible foundation

00:06:08.265 --> 00:06:11.485
and largely describes the success.

00:06:11.485 --> 00:06:15.475
But to me it's not just Indians
doing well in Silicon Valley,

00:06:15.475 --> 00:06:19.145
but what is even more exciting 
is Indians are doing well in India

00:06:19.145 --> 00:06:21.505
and from there, using India
as a global stage.

00:06:21.505 --> 00:06:24.505
I think that's been really nice to see.

00:06:24.505 --> 00:06:28.035
SRK: Sundar has said 
that the values and education

00:06:28.035 --> 00:06:29.715
given to us by our parents,

00:06:29.715 --> 00:06:32.465
I think that really is one 
of the most important reasons